          "text": "Shortness of breath"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports shortness of breath walking approximately 20–30 m from the lounge to the clothesline and on 5–6 stairs, needing to stop to catch his breath. No shortness of breath at rest."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
